sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as i3X Client
    participant R as api/routes
    participant Reg as core.registry
    participant Sub as core.subscriptions
    participant Up as adapters.upstream
    participant Th as asyncua thread loop
    participant S as OPC UA Server

    Note over C,S: Boot — browse + register
    C->>R: GET /v1/objects
    R->>Up: browse(connection)
    Up->>Th: schedule browse
    Th->>S: Browse / Read (TypeDefs, refs)
    S-->>Th: BrowseResult
    Th-->>Up: neutral BrowseResult
    Up-->>Reg: populate (objects, types, ns)
    Reg-->>R: i3X JSON (Part-6 stripped at mapping)
    R-->>C: 200 objects[]

    Note over C,S: Live values — auto-tier subscription (D-51)
    C->>R: GET /v1/objects/{id}/value/stream (SSE)
    R->>Sub: ensure subscription
    Sub->>Up: add_monitored_items(handle, [nodeId],<br/>publishing_ms?, sampling_ms?)
    Up->>Th: bucket by PublishingInterval,<br/>create asyncua.Subscription on demand
    Th->>S: CreateMonitoredItems
    S-->>Th: data change notifications
    Th-->>Sub: ValueSample (VQT, neutral)
    Sub-->>R: fan-out queue
    R-->>C: SSE: {value, quality, sourceTimestamp}

    Note over C,S: One-shot read fallback
    C->>R: POST /v1/objects/value  (no sub)
    R->>Up: read_values([nodeIds])
    Up->>Th: Read service
    Th->>S: Read
    S-->>Th: DataValues
    Th-->>R: ValueSample[] → i3X JSON
